---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { SITE } from '../../data/site';
const updated = 'August 22, 2026';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="How Greek Invest collects, uses and shares enquiry data, your GDPR rights, and the licensed Greek partners we may refer you to."
>
  <section class="site-container py-12 md:py-16 max-w-3xl">
    <h1 class="mb-2">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="text-sm text-[var(--color-muted)] mb-8">Last updated: {updated}</p>
    <div class="prose text-sm">
      <p>{SITE.name} ({SITE.url}) operates as an independent editorial website about Greek property and the
        Greek Golden Visa. This policy explains what we collect when you contact us, why, and what rights you
        have under the EU General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR), which applies because our readers and our
        subject matter are in the European Union.</p>

      <h2>Data we collect</h2>
      <p>Only what you give us in a form or an email: your name, a phone or WhatsApp number, an email address
        if you provide one, your budget range, the region or property type you are interested in, and the content
        of your message. We do not require any identity document, and we never ask for financial account details.</p>

      <h2>Why we process it</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>To answer your enquiry and prepare the research or shortlist you asked for (performance of a request you made).</li>
        <li>To refer qualified enquiries to licensed Greek lawyers and partner agents, where that is what you are asking for.</li>
        <li>To improve our content using aggregated, non-identifiable analytics (legitimate interest).</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Who we share it with</h2>
      <p>We do not sell personal data and we do not pass it to advertising networks. Where your enquiry needs a
        regulated professional, we may share the details you gave us with <strong>licensed Greek lawyers and
        partner real-estate agents</strong>, and only to the extent needed to answer that enquiry. We tell you
        when we do this. Greek Invest is not a law firm, a developer or a licensed Greek broker, and we are not
        paid by developers for editorial placement.</p>

      <h2>Where your data is held</h2>
      <p>Enquiry data is processed within the European Economic Area by our website and email providers. Where a
        provider processes data outside the EEA, that transfer relies on the European Commission's standard
        contractual clauses or an adequacy decision.</p>

      <h2>Retention</h2>
      <p>We keep enquiry records for as long as needed to service the request and to meet applicable record-keeping
        obligations, and delete them on request unless we are legally required to retain them.</p>

      <h2>Your rights under GDPR</h2>
      <p>You may request access to your data, correction of it, erasure, restriction of processing, portability,
        or object to processing based on legitimate interest. Write to <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a>
        and we will respond within one month. If you believe we have handled your data improperly, you may complain
        to the Hellenic Data Protection Authority (dpa.gr) or to the supervisory authority in your own country.</p>

      <h2>Cookies</h2>
      <p>We use essential cookies needed to serve the site, and privacy-friendly analytics. There is no third-party
        advertising or cross-site tracking on this site by default.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
